# Output the picklist dependency demo harness writes into the working tree. It lands inside
# force-app, which is the single source of truth for the framework classes the extension
# scaffolds into users' orgs, so a stray "git add -A" would commit demo-only Apex and a demo
# object into shipped source. That is not hypothetical: b6038c1 committed an "undefined/"
# capture directory exactly this way. -Step Scaffold rewrites all of it deterministically,
# so none of it needs tracking.
treecipe/
force-app/main/default/objects/Treecipe_Demo__c/
force-app/main/default/globalValueSets/Planets.globalValueSet-meta.xml
force-app/main/default/classes/SDTPLDSpecs_*.cls
force-app/main/default/classes/SDTPLDSpecs_*.cls-meta.xml
force-app/main/default/classes/SDTPLDSpecsTest.cls
force-app/main/default/classes/SDTPLDSpecsTest.cls-meta.xml
